# ACCEPTANCE: cu-003

AC-1 ConfLoader.discover returns the nearest conf/ directory walking upward from a nested working directory.
AC-2 ConfLoader.discover returns None when no conf/ exists on the path to the filesystem root.
AC-3 A missing conf/ directory yields a Left naming the directory and the start path, not an empty configuration.
AC-4 A missing pipeline file yields a Left naming that file.
AC-5 A key defined in both feeds.conf and the pipeline file resolves to the pipeline file's value.
AC-6 A key defined only in feeds.conf survives the merge.
AC-7 pipelines/ingestion/src/main/resources/application.conf no longer exists.
AC-8 ARCH.LAYOUT_LAYOUT - ConfLoader.scala sits at infrastructure/conf/, a nested folder.
AC-9 The specification reads no repository configuration file and contacts no network.
AC-10 `sbt compile` and `sbt "testOnly newspipe.ConfLoaderSpec"` exit 0 from `pipelines/ingestion`.
